    {
      "id": "kpk1-l18-b5-t01",
      "before": "kpk1-l18-b5-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "W hotelach, w górach"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "For more than one, almost every noun takes *-ach* in the locative: *w hotelach*, *w restauracjach*, *w górach*, *na nartach*. A describing word takes *-ych*, or *-ich* after *k* and *g*: *w różnych miejscach* (in different places), *w dużych miastach*, *w Stanach Zjednoczonych*. Some words are always plural: *w spodniach* (in trousers), *na Mazurach* (in Masuria, the lakes in the north-east). Gloves are usually two: *w rękawiczkach* (in gloves)."
      },
      "table": {
        "title": {
          "en": "Gdzie? Liczba mnoga"
        },
